@startuml Sequence Diagram - Receive AI Response

actor "Customer" as Customer
participant "ChatView" as ChatView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend
participant "AIService" as AIService

Customer -> ChatView : 1 Open chat widget
activate ChatView
ChatView -> ChatView : 2 Display message form

Customer -> ChatView : 3 Enter message
Customer -> ChatView : 4 Click "Send" button

ChatView -> ClerkAuth : 5 Send message request
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 6 Store message
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 7 Update conversation record
Backend -> AIService : 8 Request AI response
activate AIService
AIService -> AIService : 9 Generate response
AIService -> Backend : 10 Return AI response
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 11 Return AI response
ClerkAuth -> ChatView : 12 Return AI response
ChatView -> Customer : 13 Display AI response

deactivate AIService
deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate ChatView

@enduml
